# glossary rows
("S1","| one state, same ahead (同一状态) | Two moments of a registered history after which everything registered is the same. States are read off the history, not given as configurations; there are finitely many exactly where what is registered repeats from some moment on.","| one state, same ahead (同一状态) | Two moments of a history of values after which every value is the same. States are read off the history, not given as configurations; there are finitely many exactly where the history repeats from some moment on."),
("S7","| gap / completing unfolding (缺口／补全的展开) | For a registration indexed by what it reads, the reading obtained by moving each member's registration of itself through a map, which no member says. A registration that keeps what is registered and registers the gap next","| gap / completing unfolding (缺口／补全的展开) | For a family of readings indexed by what it reads, the reading obtained by moving each member's value at itself through a map, which no member says. A family that keeps what it said and says the gap next"),
("S7 glossary term renamed; the old term is listed under the retired names","| contextual registration / gluing (语境中的识／粘合) | Claims are registered in contexts. The registrations glue where some context-free reading agrees with every context, exactly where contexts registering the same claim register it alike.","| claims in context / gluing (语境中的主张／粘合) | Claims are shown in contexts. What the contexts show glues where some context-free reading agrees with every context, exactly where the contexts a claim lies within show it alike."),
("S1","| bound on states (状态数的界) | A registered history has at most N states:","| bound on states (状态数的界) | A history of values has at most N states:"),
("L-extrap glossary term renamed","| identification / learner given the bound (辨识／给定界的学习者) | A finite record fixes the whole course. The learner given the bound N says nothing before 2N − 1, and from then on claims the lasso hypothesis within N that the record confirms; it is refuted nowhere.","| identification / extrapolation given the bound (辨识／给定界的外推) | A finite prefix fixes the whole course. The extrapolation given the bound N stays silent before 2N − 1, and from then on proposes by the lasso candidate within N that the prefix bears out; it misses nowhere."),
("S1","| runs part (运行分开) | Two runs register alike before some step and differently at it. Where no two runs from a configuration part, they register one course.","| runs part (运行分开) | Two runs take one value through the map before some step and different values at it. Where no two runs from a configuration part, they have one course through the map."),
("L-built glossary term renamed","| learner given the world (被给予世界的学习者) | Reads off the record the configurations the run may be at, takes the first from which it can go on without end, and says the value it registers.","| extrapolation built from the process (依过程所建之外推) | Reads off the prefix the configurations the run may be at, takes the first from which it can go on without end, and proposes its value through the map."),
