("S4 glossary term renamed","| registration closure (识闭包) | The closure under being affected through what is registered (another formation exchanges with a condition it depends on or observes). It contains the influence closure and is that closure where only support is registered. Where members respond only through their own registration, what lies outside the closure is not registered within it.","| coupling closure (耦合闭包) | The closure under being affected through what couples in (another formation exchanges with a condition coupled into it, by threshold or by level). It contains the influence closure and is that closure where coupling is by threshold only. Where members respond only through their own couplings, what lies outside the closure does not show within it."),
("S2 glossary term renamed","| selection through registration (经识的选择) | A selection on histories of levels (keeping, rewarding, leaving offspring) in which histories the selector registers alike are selected alike; scoring likewise. It reaches exactly what the selector registers, and is blind outside the registration closure.","| selection through the couplings (经耦合的选择) | A selection on histories of levels (keeping, rewarding, leaving offspring) in which histories alike through the selector's couplings are selected alike; scoring likewise. It reaches exactly what couples into the selector, and tells nothing apart outside the coupling closure."),
("S2","whose registration fixes a selection; taken as what it actually registers. The more it observes, the more it can tell apart.","whose couplings fix a selection; taken as what actually couples into it. The more couples in by level, the more it can tell apart."),
("S4","| gap, of selection (缺口) | The candidate's reach closure less the selector's registration closure. In `Clearing` the ending within it is not selected by a selection through the selector's registration, and is selected by the dweller's registration and by the registrations taken together. That the gap closes only through dependence, observation or others' registration taken together is an AI reading.","| gap, of selection (缺口) | The candidate's reach closure less the selector's coupling closure. In `Clearing` the ending within it is not selected by a selection through the selector's couplings, and is selected through the dweller's couplings and through the couplings taken together. That the gap closes only through dependence, coupling by level or others' couplings taken together is an AI reading."),
("S5 glossary term renamed; Popper's term stays in correspondence fields","| refutation (否证) | No history satisfying the claim registers alike with the actual one up to some step. Relative to a model (a class of admissible histories), it refutes the model and the claim together.","| exclusion (排除) | No history satisfying the claim is alike with the actual one through the formation's couplings up to some step. Relative to a model (a class of admissible histories), it excludes the model and the claim together."),
("L-prefix glossary term renamed","| course / record (被识的序列／记录) | A sequence of registered values, for example the registration of a determined law's orbit; the record is the values before step t, latest first.","| course / prefix (经映射的历程／前段) | A sequence of values, for example a determined law's orbit read through a map; the prefix is the values before step t, latest first."),
("L-elim glossary term renamed","| learning by refutation (按否证学习) | Hypotheses are put in order, and the learner moves to the next exactly where the one it holds is refuted. It never passes a hypothesis that holds, and every one it passes is refuted in the record.","| extrapolation by elimination (逐除外推) | Candidates are put in order, and the extrapolation moves to the next exactly where the one it holds misses. It never passes a candidate that accords, and every one it passes missed within the prefix."),
("L-miss","| lasso (套索) | A sequence that repeats periodically from some step on: exactly the registration of a world a list holds. On it the lasso learner's refutations are bounded,","| lasso (套索) | A sequence that repeats periodically from some step on: exactly the course, through a map, of a world a list holds. On it the lasso extrapolation's misses are bounded,"),
("L-miss","| diagonal course (对角序列) | A sequence that at every step answers the learner's claim so as to refute it. It is the registration of a law that keeps the record, and so is open.","| diagonal course (对角序列) | A sequence that at every step answers the extrapolation's proposed value so that it misses. It is the course of a law that keeps the whole prefix, and so is open."),
