("S2","| responsive reach (回应所及) | The part's closure, between two flows, under being affected through what is registered: a member exchanges in one of the two flows with a condition another formation registers, which exchanges with one a third registers, and so on link by link. Dual to the registration closure; where only support is registered and there is one flow, it is exactly the union of the members' reach closures. Where the rest responds through registration,","| responsive reach (回应所及) | The part's closure, between two flows, under being affected through what couples in: a member exchanges in one of the two flows with a condition coupled into another formation, which exchanges with one coupled into a third, and so on link by link. Dual to the coupling closure; where coupling is by threshold only and there is one flow, it is exactly the union of the members' reach closures. Where the rest responds through its couplings,"),
